  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inception phase STS and STA Tax Project 2022-2023 - Inception phase new cooperation between STS and STA (tax project)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inception phase STS and STA Tax Project 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den Skatteverket har ans&#xf6;kt Sida om finansiering p&#xe5; 1 000 000 SEK f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra genomf&#xf6;rbarhetsfasprojekt f&#xf6;r utveckling av ett nytt samarbetsprogram med den Moldaviska  statliga skattetj&#xe4;nst under september 2021 - february 2022.

Insatsen syftar till att 1) identifiera omfattningen av ett nytt potentiellt program med beaktande av de resultat som uppn&#xe5;tts och l&#xe4;rdomarna fr&#xe5;n det f&#xf6;reg&#xe5;ende programmet och 2) konkret definiera &quot;vad&quot; det ska uppn&#xe5;s med det nya programmet och &quot;hur&quot; genom att utveckla ett konkret projektf&#xf6;rslag.

Insatsens totala budget &#xe4;r 1 000 000 SEK fullst&#xe4;ndigt t&#xe4;ckt av Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Tax Administration has applied to Sida for funding of 1 000 000 SEK to carry out the Feasibility Phase Project for development a new cooperation programme with the Moldovan State Tax Service during September 2021- February 2022. 

The intervention aims at 1) identifying the scope of a new potential programme, considering the results achieved and lessons learned from the previous programme and 2) defining in concrete terms &quot;what&quot; is to be achieved by the new programme and &quot;how&quot; by developing a concrete project proposal. 

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 1000 000 SEK fully covered by Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a short term feasibility phase type intervention. The main objective is to support the Swedish Tax Authority (STA) to develop a project proposal to continue its cooperation with the Moldovan State Tax Service. The feasibility phase will allow STA to identify and assess the needs that could be further addressed and to define the terms and conditions for a new project based on results achieved and lessons learned in the previous project in 2018-2021. 

The intervention resulted in a good quality project proposal that then became the programme document for the third phase of collaboration between the Swedish and Moldovan Tax agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
